  "aboutProtectionTitle": "How your data is protected",
  "aboutProtectionBody": "Everything you save is locked with strong encryption on this phone. Only your master password can open it, and it is never stored anywhere, not even by MÜHÜR. Without it, the data cannot be read.",
  "aboutOfflineTitle": "Works offline",
  "aboutOfflineBody": "MÜHÜR never connects to the internet. There is no account, no server and no cloud. Your passwords stay on this phone unless you export them yourself, as an encrypted backup or as an Excel file.",
  "aboutRights": "All rights reserved.",
