  "aboutInBrief": "In brief",
  "aboutTechnical": "Technical details",
  "aboutProtectionTech": "• Your vault is encrypted with a random 256-bit key. That key is sealed with AES-256-GCM using a key derived from your master password with Argon2id (32 MiB memory, 3 passes). The key-derivation settings are bound to the seal, so tampering is detected.\n• The database is encrypted with SQLCipher; its key is derived from the vault key with HKDF-SHA256.\n• Sensitive fields are encrypted again with AES-256-GCM and tied to their entry and field.\n• After 5 wrong passwords the app waits 30 seconds, doubling each time up to 1 hour. Changing the phone's clock does not shorten the wait.\n• Biometric unlock accepts only strong (Class 3) biometrics and turns itself off when a new fingerprint or face is added.\n• Screenshots and screen recording are blocked, the vault locks when you leave the app, and copied values are marked as sensitive and cleared automatically.",
  "aboutOfflineTech": "• The released version of the app has no internet or network permission; they are removed even if a library asks for them.\n• Cloud backup and device-to-device transfer are turned off, so the app's data is never copied off the phone.\n• Text recognition uses a model built into the app and runs on the phone; camera frames are processed in memory and never saved.\n• Data leaves the phone only when you export it yourself: as an encrypted backup file, or as an unencrypted Excel file whose safety is your responsibility.",
  "aboutPermissionsBody": "MÜHÜR collects no personal data, shows no ads, uses no analytics and shares nothing with anyone. It asks only for the camera (to scan text) and biometrics (to unlock). Subscriptions are handled by Google Play; the app never sees your payment details. Deleting the app deletes all of its data. Before deleting it, you can export your entries to Excel; keeping that file safe is your responsibility.",
  "aboutPermissionsTech": "• Camera: used only while the scanner is open; no photos are saved and no sound is recorded.\n• Biometrics: your fingerprint or face is checked by the phone's system window; MÜHÜR never receives that data.\n• Files: accessed only when you choose where to save or open a backup or an Excel file.\n• No account, no server, no tracking or advertising identifiers.\n• Downloading the app and buying a subscription are handled by Google Play under Google's own privacy policy.",
  "how1T": "Vault and master password",
  "how1B": "Everything is kept in an encrypted vault on this phone. Only your master password opens it. It cannot be recovered, so choose one you will remember and keep a backup.",
  "how2T": "Entries and categories",
  "how2B": "Categories are fixed: Banks, Websites, Emails, Social Media, Business and Other. When you add an entry with the + button, you choose its category, and the category brings the fields that suit it. You cannot add new categories, but you can add fields to an entry with \"Add field\": pick one from the list or create a \"Custom field\" with a name of your choice.",
  "how3T": "Copying safely",
  "how3B": "Tap a field to copy it. The clipboard clears itself after the time you set. The clipboard icon on the home screen counts down; tap it to clear right away.",
  "how4T": "Scanning with the camera",
  "how4B": "Point the camera at a card or document to read an IBAN or text instead of typing it. Check the result before saving.",
  "how5T": "Trash",
  "how5B": "Deleted entries wait in the trash, still encrypted, and can be restored until the period you set ends.",
  "how6T": "Backup and restore",
  "how6B": "Create an encrypted backup file with its own password and keep it somewhere safe. Restoring only adds entries; existing ones are never overwritten.",
  "how7T": "Locking and biometrics",
  "how7B": "The vault locks itself when you leave the app. Turn on biometrics to open it with your fingerprint or face.",
  "storyBody": "Every great invention starts with someone trying to solve a small problem in their own life. The story of MÜHÜR is exactly that: a sincere but determined journey, born from a memory lost in the chaos of the digital world and from the instinct to protect what is your own.\n\nIt all began with the annoying pause caused by a single forgotten password. I designed MÜHÜR as a personal refuge that runs only on my own device, without depending on anyone else's cloud servers. Over time I realised I was not the only one who wanted their digital privacy back.\n\nToday MÜHÜR is for everyone who wants to keep their data fully under their own control, without entrusting it to any server.\n\nSeal the safest lock on your digital memory.",
  "devBody": "MÜHÜR is an independent project by UEK DESIGNER, designed and developed in Türkiye. Thank you for using MÜHÜR.",
  "rn100": "• First release.\n• Encrypted vault on the phone, opened with a master password (Argon2id + AES-256).\n• Ready-made fields for banks, websites, e-mail, social media and business accounts.\n• Password generator with strength indicator.\n• Camera scanning for IBANs and text.\n• Fingerprint and face unlock.\n• Encrypted backup and restore.\n• Excel export (unencrypted, at your own responsibility).\n• Trash with automatic clean-up.\n• Vault summary showing reused passwords.\n• Automatic lock, screen protection and clipboard countdown.\n• Works fully offline.\n• 18 languages.",
